    "body": "What do you think about adding the <Leader>fk keymap to open the keymaps picker? Personally, I find it very useful to list all keymaps, especially when transitioning from other 'distros'.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nSuggested changes in `plugin/20_keymaps.lua`\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nnmap_leader('fk', '<Cmd>Pick keymaps<CR>', 'Keymaps')\r\n```",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">What do you think about adding the fk keymap to open the keymaps picker? Personally, I find it very useful to list all keymaps, especially when transitioning from other 'distros'.</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Suggested changes in <code class=\"notranslate\">plugin/20_keymaps.lua</code></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"nmap_leader('fk', '&lt;Cmd&gt;Pick keymaps&lt;CR&gt;', 'Keymaps')\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-c1\">nmap_leader</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>fk<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>&lt;Cmd&gt;Pick keymaps&lt;CR&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>Keymaps<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)</pre></div>",
